 can reduce compensation under California's comparative negligence laws. Settlement Value: For a typical $100,000 settlement, a victim might receive between $50,000 and $65,000 after attorney fees, medical liens, and case costs are paid. Los Angeles AreaInland Empire & San DiegoM&Y Personal Injury Lawyers: Highly rated for car accident cases; co-founded by Nick Movagar.Law Offices of Brian Breiter: Known for trial excellence and meticulous investigation of complex liability.Omega Law Group: A family-owned firm handling serious car accidents and employment disputes.Cohen & Marzban: Operates multiple offices in Downtown LA, Westside, Pasadena, and Encino.McCune Law Group (Inland Empire): Noted for high-value verdicts in manufacturing defect and motorcycle cases.Singleton Schreiber (San Diego): Fearless advocates handling cases against powerful corporations and government bodies.Jurewitz Law Group (San Diego): Specialized in motor vehicle accidents and nursing home abuse claims.Ben Crump Law (Riverside): National firm providing aggressive representation for civil rights and personal injury. Los Angeles AreaInland Empire & San Diego Los Angeles AreaInland Empire & San Diego M&Y Personal Injury Lawyers: Highly rated for car accident cases; co-founded by Nick Movagar.Law Offices of Brian Breiter: Known for trial excellence and meticulous investigation of complex liability.Omega Law Group: A family-owned firm handling serious car accidents and employment disputes.Cohen & Marzban: Operates multiple offices in Downtown LA, Westside, Pasadena, and Encino. M&Y Personal Injury Lawyers: Highly rated for car accident cases; co-founded by Nick Movagar. Law Offices of Brian Breiter: Known for trial excellence and meticulous investigation of complex liability. Omega Law Group: A family-owned firm handling serious car accidents and employment disputes. Cohen & Marzban: Operates multiple offices in Downtown LA, Westside, Pasadena, and Encino. McCune Law Group (Inland Empire): Noted fo